PROSE AROUND THE FORMS

Only parenthesised forms run. Prose around them is skipped; an aside naming nothing that exists is prose too.
- Do it ONLY when user's request is FULLY satisfied. Until then every reply carries a form.
- Never answer in bare prose mid-task. Remarks go around a form.
- Prose alone ends the loop. Never mention a skipped-form note to user.
Details: memory/recall "prose/final", "prose/skipped", or by trigger.
